(6951450, 1048026, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gelukkig nieuw jaar is Dutch for New Year I think. Nice image - different look at celebrations.</td>', 'Gelukkig nieuw jaar is Dutch for New Year I think. Nice image - different look at celebrations.', '2013-01-07 16:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951452, 1048239, 101256, '<td valign="top">The first time I saw this I had to readjust my monitor to make sure I wasn''t seeing what I was seeing.  Turns out that the monitor was perfect so I wasn''t a technical issue. For some reason this just looks washed out to me - the color just doesn''t "pop" if you will.  Plus there is a lighting remnant on the right at the top of the glass which distracts.</td>', 'The first time I saw this I had to readjust my monitor to make sure I wasn''t seeing what I was seeing.  Turns out that the monitor was perfect so I wasn''t a technical issue. For some reason this just looks washed out to me - the color just doesn''t "pop" if you will.  Plus there is a lighting remnant on the right at the top of the glass which distracts.', '2013-01-07 16:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951453, 1048124, 101256, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy just wanted to see what it was. After all, a dog''s world is seen through his sniffer. :&gt;)  Cute image.</td>', 'Poor little guy just wanted to see what it was. After all, a dog''s world is seen through his sniffer. :>)  Cute image.', '2013-01-07 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951454, 1048231, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - gorgeous. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful image - gorgeous. Well done.', '2013-01-07 16:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951456, 1047656, 101256, '<td valign="top">Definitely a celebration.  A good snapshot quality image. Colors look a little weak, but I think that is a result of the over done whites on the sparklers.</td>', 'Definitely a celebration.  A good snapshot quality image. Colors look a little weak, but I think that is a result of the over done whites on the sparklers.', '2013-01-07 16:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951458, 1048204, 101256, '<td valign="top">Might have worked better with a little more detail - my opinion you understand. Still, the focus on the flames makes it a pretty good image. I like it.</td>', 'Might have worked better with a little more detail - my opinion you understand. Still, the focus on the flames makes it a pretty good image. I like it.', '2013-01-07 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951459, 1048160, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good snapshot, but what''s up with that hand/arm shadow on the umbrella? I might have taken that out because it is really annoying.</td>', 'A good snapshot, but what''s up with that hand/arm shadow on the umbrella? I might have taken that out because it is really annoying.', '2013-01-07 16:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951460, 1048139, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes out of the box imagery works in a challenge, sometimes it doesn''t - this is the later. Unfortunate because I thought of a couple of titles that would have made this work.</td>', 'Sometimes out of the box imagery works in a challenge, sometimes it doesn''t - this is the later. Unfortunate because I thought of a couple of titles that would have made this work.', '2013-01-07 16:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951462, 1048138, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the grain is way over done.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the grain is way over done.', '2013-01-07 16:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951463, 1048077, 101256, '<td valign="top">Heh - ok - a little cold to swim on Christmas Vacation. A good looking snapshot quality image.</td>', 'Heh - ok - a little cold to swim on Christmas Vacation. A good looking snapshot quality image.', '2013-01-07 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951467, 1048251, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would have worked with a more contrasty background - the top of the white balloon disappears into the clouds. It also looks like the author tried to correct the bronze balloon reflection on the red one and it bled over. More lighting on the subject would have helped.</td>', 'This would have worked with a more contrasty background - the top of the white balloon disappears into the clouds. It also looks like the author tried to correct the bronze balloon reflection on the red one and it bled over. More lighting on the subject would have helped.', '2013-01-07 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951470, 1048041, 101256, '<td valign="top">The whites are a little overdone, but that''s always an issue at night. I''m not much for firework photos as it really takes some skill to do it properly, but the overall scene here does work.</td>', 'The whites are a little overdone, but that''s always an issue at night. I''m not much for firework photos as it really takes some skill to do it properly, but the overall scene here does work.', '2013-01-07 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951471, 1048152, 101256, '<td valign="top">Boy do I like this - beautiful image. The wing detail is fantastic. Well done.</td>', 'Boy do I like this - beautiful image. The wing detail is fantastic. Well done.', '2013-01-07 16:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951475, 1048114, 101256, '<td valign="top">HDR can do a lot for an image and this is a good example.  Probably not to everybody''s taste, but I like it.</td>', 'HDR can do a lot for an image and this is a good example.  Probably not to everybody''s taste, but I like it.', '2013-01-07 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6951478, 1048175, 101256, '<td valign="top">You don''t see silhouettes all that often in photography - this is a pretty good example of silhouette imagery that does work. Well done.</td>', 'You don''t see silhouettes all that often in photography - this is a pretty good example of silhouette imagery that does work. Well done.', '2013-01-07 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
