(6957232, 1048171, 66952, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Bear!!!!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gcoulson:</b></div><hr/><i> How did you get a 9 and 10 for this? :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can see someone giving it a 9 or 10, because it is indeed a cool image. What I can''t fathom is the 69 4''s and 5''s. The image is anything but average. I would expect a bunch of votes on both the high and low end (mostly low, because I can''t see how it possibly meets the challenge), but not much in the middle.</td>', 'Congrats, Bear!!!! Originally posted by gcoulson: How did you get a 9 and 10 for this? :)   I can see someone giving it a 9 or 10, because it is indeed a cool image. What I can''t fathom is the 69 4''s and 5''s. The image is anything but average. I would expect a bunch of votes on both the high and low end (mostly low, because I can''t see how it possibly meets the challenge), but not much in the middle.', '2013-01-14 13:20:45.000000', NULL, 0),
