(6985293, 1048258, 138630, '<td valign="top">You may or may not be aware that this is one of the photos being used in the online "publications" referenced here: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1188924" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPC forum thread on LBNelert</a> <br/>I noticed it when I was searching for my own. There were so many from DPC that I could not document them all - if you want to have it removed, see posts from LydiaToo and Mike_311 on p. 5 of the forum thread. To locate it more easily, check both blogs and the main newsletter, starting with the dates when this challenge was in voting or shortly thereafter.</td>', 'You may or may not be aware that this is one of the photos being used in the online "publications" referenced here: DPC forum thread on LBNelert I noticed it when I was searching for my own. There were so many from DPC that I could not document them all - if you want to have it removed, see posts from LydiaToo and Mike_311 on p. 5 of the forum thread. To locate it more easily, check both blogs and the main newsletter, starting with the dates when this challenge was in voting or shortly thereafter.', '2013-02-24 15:00:08.000000', NULL, 0);
